    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSpring has come to the satoyama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanuki-kun receives a letter from Kitsune-kun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dLet's have lunch together under the cherry blossom tree!\u201c\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satoyama note Spring walk is a point-and-click visual novel in which you aim for a destination while identifying plants in the satoyama in spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanuki-kun follows the memo in the letter and heads for the cherry blossom tree while identifying the plants along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click visual novel depicting the lives of creatures in a mountain village in spring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live background music played on a Japanese transverse flute, and a hand-drawn world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed through the forest while observing and identifying plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the animals in the mountain village talk about the plants</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cSpring has come to the satoyama.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tanuki-kun receives a letter from Kitsune-kun.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201dLet's have lunch together under the cherry blossom tree!\u201c\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Satoyama note Spring walk is a point-and-click visual novel in which you aim for a destination while identifying plants in the satoyama in spring.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tanuki-kun follows the memo in the letter and heads for the cherry blossom tree while identifying the plants along the way.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A point-and-click visual novel depicting the lives of creatures in a mountain village in spring</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Live background music played on a Japanese transverse flute, and a hand-drawn world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proceed through the forest while observing and identifying plants</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Listen to the animals in the mountain village talk about the plants</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Satoyama note Spring walk is a point-and-click visual novel in which you aim to reach your destination while identifying plants in a satoyama in spring. Listen to the animals, observe and identify the plants as you make your way through the forest, and have lunch under the cherry blossom trees!",
